== Notes ==

* Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* This spell gives a 50% bonus to movement speed not a 150%.
* The "if the caster is already hasted" clause refers specifically to the spell ''[[haste (spell)|haste]]''; other sources of [[haste]] (including ''[[mass haste]]'') do not block this spell (but the movement rate cap is often relevant).
* This spell stacks with itself (up to the movement rate cap).

